cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Melinoe in research, please cite the software using this metadata."
title: "Melinoe: a validity-aware environment for multimodal cancer research"
type: software
version: 0.4.0
date-released: 2026-09-27
authors:
  - family-names: Markarian
    given-names: Mark Barsoum
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/MarkBarsoumMarkarian/melinoe"
url: "https://github.com/MarkBarsoumMarkarian/melinoe"
abstract: >-
  Melinoe is a local-first cancer-research environment that connects explicit
  patient, specimen, assay, endpoint, and split provenance with deterministic
  validity gates, contained execution, portable research records, and
  reference-validated analysis workflows.
keywords:
  - cancer research
  - bioinformatics
  - reproducibility
  - survival analysis
  - research software
